ag gsum/} {thugs rje chen po dang bco brgyad do//} {'di rnams zag med ye shes sde tshan nyer gcig gi khongs su gtogs so/ /}
sangs rgyas kyi chos ma 'dres pa bco brgyad|{de bzhin gshegs pa la 'khrul ba mi mnga' ba dang /} {ca co mi mnga' ba/} {bsnyel ba mi mnga' ba/} {mnyam par ma bzhag pa mi mnga' ba/} {tha dad pa'i 'du shes mi mnga' ba/} {ma brtags pa'i btang snyoms mi mnga' ba/} {'dun pa nyams pa mi mnga' ba/} {brtson 'grus nyams pa mi mnga' ba/} {dran pa nyams pa mi mnga' ba/} {shes rab nyams pa mi mnga' ba/} {ting nge 'dzin nyams pa mi mnga' ba/} {rnam par grol ba nyams pa mi mnga' ba/} {lus kyi las thams cad ye shes sngon du 'gro zhing ye shes kyi rjes su 'brang ba/} {ngag gi las thams cad ye shes sngon du 'gro zhing ye shes kyi rjes su 'brang ba/} {yid kyi las thams cad ye shes sngon du 'gro zhing ye shes kyi rjes su 'brang ba/} {'das pa'i dus la ma chags ma thogs pa'i ye shes gzigs pa 'jug pa/} {ma 'ongs pa'i dus la ma chags ma thogs pa'i ye shes gzigs pa 'jug pa/} {da lta'i dus la ma chags ma thogs pa'i ye shes gzigs pa 'jug pa ste bco brgyad/}
