sangs rgyas kyi lung|{spyir dam pa'i chos kyi lung ni ngo bo'i sgo nas dbye na rnam pa bcus legs par gsungs pa'i bka' dang bka'i dgongs pa 'grel ba'i bstan bcos gnyis yod pa las/} {snga ma'i dbang du byas na rang gi bdag rkyen sangs rgyas la brten nas byung ba'i gsung rab gang zhig rnam pa bcus legs par gsungs pa'i bka'o/} {/rnam pa bcu ni rnam bshad rigs par ji ltar na legs par gsungs pa yin no zhe na/} {rnam pa bcu dag gis te/} {1} {yang dag par blang ba nyid kyis dang /} {2} {dbang du mdzad pa nyid kyis dang /} {3} {'jug pa nyid kyis dang /} {4} {rab tu bstan pa nyid kyis dang /} {5} {rab tu dbye ba nyid kyis dang /} {6} {rten nyid kyis dang /} {7} {go bar mdzad pa nyid kyis dang /} {8} {gdags pa nyid kyis dang /} {9} {dus nyid kyis dang /} {10} {yon tan yongs su 'dzin pa nyid kyis so/} {/zhes so/ /}
