sangs rgyas kyi 'phrin las nyer bdun|{zhi ba'i las la 'god pa/} {gzhan rgyud smin byed bsdu bzhi la 'god pa/} {blang dor rtogs pa la 'god pa ste tshogs lam 'god pa'i 'phrin las gsum/} {gnas lugs kyi don rtogs pa la 'god pa/} {phyin drug rdzogs byed la 'god pa/} {gnyis don spyod pa la 'god pa bzhi/} {lta ba rnams dag la 'god pa ste sbyor lam la 'god pa bzhi/} {stong nyid mngon sum du gsar du rtogs pa la 'god pa ste mthong lam la 'god pa gcig} {sa gnyis pa nas lnga pa'i bar la 'god pa/} {sa drug pa la 'god pa/} {bdun pa la 'god pa/} {brgyad pas bsdus pa'i spyod pa khyad par can la 'god pa/} {bden 'dzin mngon gyur zad pa la 'god pa/} {sa dgu pa la 'god pa/} {sa bcu thob ma thag pa la 'god pa/} {skye ba gcig thogs kyis bsdus pa'i skye ba phyi mar 'tshang rgya bar nges pa la 'god pa/} {gzhan don lhun grub la 'god pa/} {sangs rgyas kyi chos lhag ma rdzogs pa la 'god pa/} {srid pa tha mas bsdus pa'i byang chub 'dren par byed pa la 'god pa/} {las chud mi za ba la 'god pa/} {ji snyed pa rtogs pa la 'god pa/} {ji lta ba rtogs pa la 'god pa/} {phyin ci log zad pa la 'god pa/} {gzhi med pa la 'god pa/} {rnam byang rdzogs pa la 'god pa/} {srid zhi mnyam nyid la 'god pa'i 'phrin las te sgom lam la 'god pa bco brgyad/} {mi gnas pa'i myang 'das la 'god pa ste 'bras bu la 'god pa gcig ste nyer bdun no/ /}
